  tpm2-tss / tpm2-abrmd .... BSD-2-Clause
  swtpm / libtpms .......... BSD-3-Clause (nur Software-TPM / software TPM only)
  Python cryptography ...... Apache-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause
  OpenSSL .................. Apache-2.0
  OpenSSH .................. BSD-style
  curl ..................... curl license (MIT-style)
  MariaDB .................. GPL-2.0 (eigenständiges Programm / separate program, Web-Demo)
  PHP ...................... PHP License v3.01 (Web-Demo)
  WordPress ................ GPL-2.0-or-later (wird bei der Einrichtung heruntergeladen / downloaded at setup)
  xrdp, FreeRDP ............ Apache-2.0 (RDP-Demo)
